{
    "word": "discomfiture",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "e4089d71-a1b3-306a-b6a8-48124df3692c",
                "word": "discomfiture",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "366e2672-19ba-4348-afd9-27c659c425f5",
                        "entry_id": "e4089d71-a1b3-306a-b6a8-48124df3692c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "discomfitures"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "795c705a-5540-3ead-a6b2-1ec78bf9ee47",
                        "entry_id": "e4089d71-a1b3-306a-b6a8-48124df3692c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Defeat in battle."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "obsolete",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "242ba24f-db28-3eff-92e2-f0d73f8fee9e",
                        "entry_id": "e4089d71-a1b3-306a-b6a8-48124df3692c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An emotional state similar to that arising from defeat; frustration, disappointment, perplexity or embarrassment."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "44ac9e44-fc41-4974-8141-9588eff8bfb0",
                                "sense_id": "242ba24f-db28-3eff-92e2-f0d73f8fee9e",
                                "text": "Some of us are concerned because as yet the South shows no penitence. But what exactly do we mean by this? Since down to the close of the war she never confessed any for braving it, the only penitence now left her is that which springs solely from the sense of discomfiture; and since this evidently would be a contrition hypocritical, it would be unworthy in us to demand it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2694516f-c750-4833-8011-51570c246371",
                                "sense_id": "242ba24f-db28-3eff-92e2-f0d73f8fee9e",
                                "text": "One of them ended its career as a passenger carrying vehicle in 1907, by freezing in Kemp Town Tunnel, to the discomfiture of some important season ticket holders, who did not hesitate to let the directors know what they thought about the incident."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dee5dd42-3720-420f-9ea7-598c9d282b5f",
                                "sense_id": "242ba24f-db28-3eff-92e2-f0d73f8fee9e",
                                "text": "Other countries are not so much angry as avid to exploit the discomfiture of the US or the chaos in the region or both."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6287d76d-2396-4c91-8e73-c16e14a62b2d",
                        "source_entry_id": "e4089d71-a1b3-306a-b6a8-48124df3692c",
                        "source_sense_description": "a feeling of frustration, disappointment, perplexity or embarrassment",
                        "target_lang_word": "Unbehagen",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Unbehagen",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74d0b03a-ffdc-32b9-aae1-497662bc7c94",
                                        "entry_id": "2f9364d0-248d-3f67-ba6c-1e87b1956500",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ein unbestimmtes Gefühl des Sich-Nicht-Wohlfühlens (körperlich oder seelisch)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b37ad15b-a5e9-40d2-91ee-7de599ee5699",
                                                "sense_id": "74d0b03a-ffdc-32b9-aae1-497662bc7c94",
                                                "text": "„Aber wie sollte man unfassbares Unbehagen in Worte kleiden, das sich in eine Wolke wandelte und davon wirbelte wie der Wind?“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb9e1643-51c2-481a-b245-ecf0ac227037",
                                                "sense_id": "74d0b03a-ffdc-32b9-aae1-497662bc7c94",
                                                "text": "„Während Hearn ihre Gesichter prüfte, stellte er ein leichtes Unbehagen auf ihnen fest.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8d3e5a1-4164-4191-88f8-38f218d8e263",
                                                "sense_id": "74d0b03a-ffdc-32b9-aae1-497662bc7c94",
                                                "text": "„Die undurchsichtigen Vorgänge von der Levanteküste haben bei Althistorikern, Ausgräbern und Kunstgeschichtlern Unbehagen ausgelöst.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c13a7e24-19e6-46ec-9414-f592adac85d6",
                                                "sense_id": "74d0b03a-ffdc-32b9-aae1-497662bc7c94",
                                                "text": "„Sie kehrten zurück, kletterten über die umgestürzten Eisentore und nahmen ihre Fahrräder, schüttelten das Unbehagen ab und schwangen sich auf die Sättel.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "706c8b4f-5c2f-47fd-b58f-a580b0090f4a",
                        "source_entry_id": "e4089d71-a1b3-306a-b6a8-48124df3692c",
                        "source_sense_description": "a feeling of frustration, disappointment, perplexity or embarrassment",
                        "target_lang_word": "Peinlichkeit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Peinlichkeit",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27607249-cd9b-391d-b0ec-488a98fe4346",
                                        "entry_id": "39371e47-7601-35ec-9460-df4c85d015cb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "etwas, das als peinlich empfunden wird"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9af5d104-fb7c-4e4c-8671-89ffa71da63e",
                                                "sense_id": "27607249-cd9b-391d-b0ec-488a98fe4346",
                                                "text": "Es war eine Peinlichkeit ersten Ranges, als er dem Botschafter quer durch den Raum lautstark zuprostete."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ab45ae2-0ce2-459f-a0d5-abf3fd994648",
                                                "sense_id": "27607249-cd9b-391d-b0ec-488a98fe4346",
                                                "text": "„Sie wollte Eos erniedrigen, wollte ihr Peinlichkeiten ohne Ende bescheren und hatte sich doch gründlich verschätzt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "208f6f24-dbe2-4058-bb3c-7aeb70eb2c8c",
                                                "sense_id": "27607249-cd9b-391d-b0ec-488a98fe4346",
                                                "text": "„Die Grenze zur Peinlichkeit ist schnell erreicht und schnell überschritten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5cd5876-f300-4808-9760-9233bf5c1380",
                                                "sense_id": "27607249-cd9b-391d-b0ec-488a98fe4346",
                                                "text": "„Es war unhöflich, aber unvermeidlich, und ich war mir der Peinlichkeit durchaus bewußt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfe1d596-3a3c-476d-a7e2-a636cb61bb7e",
                                                "sense_id": "27607249-cd9b-391d-b0ec-488a98fe4346",
                                                "text": "„Die Peinlichkeit des Vergangeen, unter der Robert litt, kam an sie nicht heran.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a7c92e7d-7dbe-3c8b-8a16-6b25b634e472",
                                        "entry_id": "39371e47-7601-35ec-9460-df4c85d015cb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "übermäßige Genauigkeit"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3cf76c1-fedc-45c9-80f2-a2b54e9dc30c",
                                                "sense_id": "a7c92e7d-7dbe-3c8b-8a16-6b25b634e472",
                                                "text": "Die grüblerische Peinlichkeit des Pedanten. (I. Kant)"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
